; XAGUSD combined config: only ONE toggle beat the S0_baseline (PF 1.43)
; in the ablation series - ADX gate ON (S1: PF 1.57, exp $11.01, n=37).
; Every other toggle (vol-scaling on, no-retest-limit, no-friday-flatten)
; made things worse, so S0's other choices are kept as-is; this is
; S0 + the one genuine improvement.
; Run: python autotest.py --model 1 --symbol XAGUSD S5_silver_tuned
; n=37 in S1 was above the 30-trade floor but on the low side - confirm
; this holds with more data before treating it as settled.

